# Build context = deploy/hosted. Only what the Dockerfile copies goes to the remote builder.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!data-tools.sh
!dist/
# Never, even inside dist/ (plan 5.7: no secrets in the image).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.map
**/*.mpd
**/*.mpd.prev
**/*.mpd.tmp
# A tree staged with the desktop bundle is for the local file-list check only, never for a deploy.
dist/STAGED-WITH-LOCAL-FALLBACK
